# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# This app needs NO API keys.
#
# Puter uses a "user-pays" model: every visitor signs in with their
# own Puter account, and AI usage is billed to that account. There is
# no secret for you (the developer) to store.
#
# IMPORTANT for future projects:
# Any variable that starts with VITE_ is copied into the JavaScript
# bundle that every visitor downloads. It is PUBLIC. Never put API
# keys, passwords or tokens in a VITE_ variable. Secrets belong on a
# server, never in frontend code.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# Optional: force a specific Puter AI model. Leave empty for Puter's default.
# See https://developer.puter.com/ai/models/ for model names.
VITE_AI_MODEL=
